- **Pipeline**: Script (OpenRouter) → Voice (ElevenLabs) → Video (D-ID)
- **Quality Gates**: Hook score ≥70, 100-250 words, 50-110 seconds
- **Multi-Format**: YouTube (landscape), TikTok (portrait), Instagram (square)
- **Cost per Video**: ~$0.50 USD

**Pipeline Stages**:
